["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tokenization, Agentic Trading, Harmonic: Robinhood&#x27;s Mission to Expand Ownership with CEO Vlad Tenev MCP KPI contracts license to operate accredited investor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-nopriors-加密货币靠散户持有赢了政治战-ai却把散户完全排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd877a74a55b6594-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>加密貨幣靠散戶持有贏了政治戰，AI卻把散戶完全排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">散戶從一開始就持有加密貨幣，因此在監管收緊時能組織起來反擊；但私募市場把普通人擋在AI獨角獸的融資輪外，只能承受數據中心的噪音和失業風險，卻分不到一分錢漲幅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代幣化</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Breaking Down Our Investment Portfolios | #434 benign neglect idiosyncratic risk covered call fund income satiation Fama-French five-factor model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-rationalreminder-这位信奉指数投资的基金经理-却把大笔身家押在自己公司股票上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>這位信奉指數投資的基金經理，卻把大筆身家押在自己公司股票上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ben明知「別重倉僱主股票」是常識，仍把被收購的PWL股權轉入OneDigital——他說這是自己主動選的特質風險，因為他是公司參與者，不是領薪水的旁觀者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產配置</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Music Can Be Medicine, with Dr. Dan Levitin default mode network endogenous opioids basal ganglia aphantasia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-sciencevs-音乐止痛是真实的神经机制-但你得先喜欢这首歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>音樂止痛是真實的神經機制，但你得先喜歡這首歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學家用冰桶測試證實，喜歡的音樂會讓大腦釋放堪比嗎啡的內源性阿片類物質來提升痛覺閾值，而討厭的音樂只會釋放皮質醇讓人更緊張。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">音樂治療</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Bosworth on What Comes After Lula&#x27;s Stunning Win status of forces agreement chavistas\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-oddlots-巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投-押注87-的预测市场全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>巴西大選次輪變成對首輪領先者的公投，押注87%的預測市場全錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為選民厭惡現任者，首輪投票選出的「贏家」反而把全部火力引向自己，讓原本落後的盧拉在次輪完成反超。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">巴西大選</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Health Insurance in America Blue Cross Red Scare Campaigns, Inc. wage and price controls\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-throughline-锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外-而是艾森豪威尔的选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1989x1989+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F02%2F15%2Fa2ebac794881a9c592b8881be551%2F4c34746d-230d-4248-8438-6f7a55f11d5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>鎖定美國僱主醫保的不是二戰意外，而是艾森豪威爾的選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二戰工資管制只是讓僱主醫保偶然發芽，真正讓它變成美國永久制度的，是1950年代艾森豪威爾政府主動把這項稅收優惠永久寫進法律。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫保史</span><span class=\"tag\">僱主醫保</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Britain&#x27;s First Homo Sapiens LRJ (Lincombeian-Ranisian-Jerzmanowician) leaf points marine isotope stage 3 (MIS3) prism system Aurignacian\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-ancients-英国最早智人化石的年代-可能被保存用的胶水测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5d9c468a9839ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>英國最早智人化石的年代，可能被保存用的膠水測錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這塊1927年出土的下頜骨被測定為三萬五千年前，但修復用的膠水會讓放射性碳測年失真，研究者認為實際年代應該更早。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">舊石器時代</span><span class=\"tag\">尼安德特人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Think About Angel Investors As A Solo Founder | Julian Weisser, Solo Founders pulling the thread co-founder of convenience / co-founder of strength key man risk\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-solofounders-创业公司死于合伙人分手-独立创始人死于失去希望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37e9a6bbbf712536-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>創業公司死於合夥人分手，獨立創始人死於失去希望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示約三分之二的創業公司因團隊問題而死，合夥人分手是頭號殺手；獨立創始人沒有這個風險，但要獨自扛住孤立感和失去動量的風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天使投資</span><span class=\"tag\">獨立創始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"720. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: Revenge of the Red Army (Part 2) Goulash Communism Operation Whirlwind Presidium\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-restishistory-匈牙利宣布退出华沙条约-其实在苏军已经打进来之后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4411977400325163-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>匈牙利宣布退出華沙條約，其實在蘇軍已經打進來之後</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">納吉在電臺宣布中立、退出華沙條約時，蘇聯軍隊其實已經越過邊境，這是絕望之舉而非挑釁，卻也沒能換來聯合國或西方任何實質援助。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰史</span><span class=\"tag\">匈牙利1956年革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"410. JFK: Blood On The Streets Of Dallas (Part 4) magic bullet theory grassy knoll Warren Commission Zapruder film\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-empirehist-阴谋论经久不衰-是因为人们不愿接受一个小人物能扳倒总统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">56:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>陰謀論經久不衰，是因為人們不願接受一個小人物能扳倒總統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普利策傳記作者說，法證證據有力指向奧斯瓦爾德獨自開槍，他認為人們抗拒這個結論，是因為不願相信如此重大的歷史轉折只憑一個邊緣人物就能達成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪遇刺</span><span class=\"tag\">陰謀論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"WWI&#x27;s Stalingrad: The Siege of Przemyśl Galicia little Russians ring of steel guncotton Battle of Gorlice-Tarnów\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-historyhit-一发受潮的炸药-可能让一战没有在1915年结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda40672b88b5654-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>一發受潮的炸藥，可能讓一戰沒有在1915年結束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一座碉堡的大門因炸藥受潮當夜沒被炸開，奧匈帝國僥倖沒有當場崩潰——節目認為，這類偶然正是一戰沒有在1915年結束、反而打到1918年的關鍵之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一戰</span><span class=\"tag\">東線戰場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"19.AI眼鏡殺手級應用在哪裡？影目楊龍昇先給了個相親的答案 BB方案 PMF SLAM inside out\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-tanpai-市场都在看好ai眼镜-这位创始人说明后两年更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"攤\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">攤牌｜創業觀察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>市場都在看好AI眼鏡，這位創始人說明後兩年更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他判斷當前眼鏡市場規模只有兩三百萬臺，還要被蘋果、Meta和國內大廠擠壓，真正的拐點要等供應鏈、內容生態和產品同時成熟的2028至2029年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI眼鏡</span><span class=\"tag\">AR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: How Do Financial Professionals Invest Their Own Money? spreadsheet optimal behaviorally optimal\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-mastersinbiz-连理财专家也提前还房贷-留过多现金-只为心安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1b7885ac5e511e1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>連理財專家也提前還房貸、留過多現金——只為心安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">50位基金經理、顧問在新書裡坦白：明知提前還房貸、持有超額現金在數學上不划算，他們還是這麼做了，因為心理安穩比理論回報更重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為金融</span><span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Good Fight Club: Trump Rebuked emotional capture rings of commitment stolen pride blue tsunami gerrymandering competitive authoritarianism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-goodfight-特朗普选民没有觉醒-只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普選民沒有覺醒，只是外層支持被生活成本層層剝落</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物價、汽油和住房成本把特朗普的情感俘獲一層層剝開，卻沒有擊穿那個仍然忠誠的核心選民群體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">中期選舉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Go From Researcher to Founder CCG CQC SME\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-ycsp-说不清解决什么问题-nhs里就没人知道该为你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/968e72a6de5d364b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">9:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>說不清解決什麼問題，NHS裡就沒人知道該為你買單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每個創業者都該能一句話說清解決了誰的問題，這樣才能被導向NHS裡真正管那件事的人，再問他願不願意付錢——這才是醫療創業的起點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療創新</span><span class=\"tag\">NHS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bernhard von Gudden: Ludwig II’s Psychiatrist somatic psychiatry non-restraint policy retrospective diagnosis Pick&#x27;s disease\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-stuffmissed-写报告前-医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>寫報告前，醫生沒見過那位被判精神失常的國王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">路德維希二世被廢黜的依據，是一份古登從未問診國王本人、只憑政敵證詞寫成的精神病報告；兩人隨後雙雙溺斃，死因至今成謎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">王室秘聞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Richard Hanania on Conrad&#x27;s Nostromo, Latin American Crime, and Populism material interests negro liberalism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-tyler-一本写于1904年的小说-精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42df6b9f173f5224-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>一本寫於1904年的小說，精準預演了拉美民粹政治的死循環</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小說裡外國資本把礦業變成國家支柱，也帶來發展，但煽動家和腐敗將領輪番上位的循環從未被打破——這是拉美政治至今未解的死結。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">發展經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New AI Agents That Shop, Plan, and Gossip OpenClaw Moltbook MCP picnic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-a16z-ai助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露-而是让你当众出丑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>AI助理最大的信任障礙不是隱私洩露，而是讓你當眾出醜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用戶嘴上說擔心隱私，真正在意的是不被agent說漏嘴而丟臉——這才是阻礙信任、拖慢滲透的真正瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">消費產品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Frontier Model Economics, AI&#x27;s Slowdown, and the Cursor Deal - [Invest Like the Best, EP.498] mythical man month NeoCloud NeoLab OLTP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-ilt-最强模型拿下八成市场-但护城河只够撑三到六个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\