"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>讀書只讀到初中畢業，他把吹風機做到了全球銷量第一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他造載人飛行器、賣電動滑板車兩次燒光借來的錢，卻靠自學攢下的無刷電機技術，後來把吹風機做到戴森五分之一的價格，賣成全球銷量第一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件創業</span><span class=\"tag\">國產替代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡️ The 2026 Software Factory Standard — Zach Lloyd, Warp.dev software factory harness scorers / online evals factory engineering ADLC/SDLC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-latentspace-pr成本从80美元砍到20美元-不是换模型-是把工厂写成代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">34:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>PR成本從80美元砍到20美元，不是換模型，是把工廠寫成代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Warp把內部軟件工廠整個定義成代碼並接入觀測閉環後，靠「觀察-測量-調優」把每個PR成本從80美元壓到15到20美元，PR吞吐同時提升40%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軟件工廠</span><span class=\"tag\">agent編排</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3 new scandals show being a pain in the ass for AI labs is a legit job now | Rob Wiblin looped transformers chain of thought non-disparagement agreement federal preemption Not For Private Gain campaign\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-eightythousand-anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的ai训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d70069c16841d26d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的法案讓人幾乎沒法叫停危險的AI訓練</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法案把叫停權壓縮成商務部長簽字、一家特區法院45天內拍板，模型真出事時幾乎來不及按下剎車。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E208 A股又是大震盪，價值投資的實踐、挑戰和思考 | 永慶、David 對談弘尚資產張駿\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-touzishizhan-亏钱不是a股的错-是你对它的认知不够/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/478f2b894977699e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>虧錢不是A股的錯，是你對它的認知不夠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張駿復盤今年60多的累計回撤後發現，A股牛短熊長、資金久期短的根源，從來不是市場本身，而是投資者對公司內在價值和宏觀週期的認知跟不上變化的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span><span class=\"tag\">內在價值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"老黃經濟學：一口氣看懂英偉達的商業帝國 Jevons Paradox DSXPORT Productive / Fungible / Durable circular financing ACIE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-laoshi-下一财年-英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1f942ceb55eb0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>下一財年，英偉達四分之一營收要靠自己給客戶撐腰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達一邊把GPU包裝成可融資資產，一邊自掏腰包投資AI實驗室、幫客戶墊錢買自己的芯片，循環融資撐起營收，也讓應收賬款飆到631億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">循環融資</span>\n</div></div></a>"]